Production vocabulary for active Power Codes and Temperaments is **not** generic — apply **DYNAMIC POWER CODE & TEMPERAMENT INJECTION** (CODE_TRANSLATION_MATRIX). The user block may supply a pre-computed **C_final** modifier string; weave it into Block 1 and echo sentiment in Block 2 meta-tags on v5.5. When multiple codes are active, blend their genre-specific strings logically; where two codes conflict on production feel, the most recently listed code wins. **Never** raise Block 1 length caps.

