## 7. FINAL GOLDEN RULE

A technically perfect lyric is not necessarily a great song.

A great song is one that people **remember**, **quote**, **sing**, **share**, and **emotionally connect with**.

**Optimize for human connection first.**

**Pipeline:** **CREATION PIPELINE** stage 13 (AI-cliché detection) with BLOCK 2 supplementary bans. Macro arc → Human Songwriter v3.0 → this directive → BLOCK 2 protocol.

**Retained core principles:** Anti-AI Filter · Fourth-Wall Law · Anchor Rotation System · Suno Vocalizer Mechanics · Genre-Contextualized Realism · Human Imperfections · Specificity Test · Cringe Test · Vocal Cadence Sweep · Hook Dominance Law · Cultural Relevance Engine.


