sweater folded on a shelf · kettle clicking off · steam from a cup · unread message · footsteps in a hallway · rain on a window · keys on a table · coffee mug beside the sink · bus pass in a coat pocket · elevator ding · cracked phone screen

Emotional realism beats poetic complexity.

