## §3 — GENRE-AWARE LYRIC DENSITY

Festival / melodic electronic lanes → **GENRE-SPECIFIC HUMANIZATION ENGINE** (after **§12 Cultural Realism Engine** when audience locale applies) + **Music Creation §2** low-density SPB. Prioritize chant-friendly hooks; do not force festival simplicity on rap, country storytelling, or jazz vocalese.

Route genre-native behavior and density → **§3A** + **§3B** before applying generic realism defaults.

