Choruses: one sticky hook · plain emotional core · singable on repeat. Apply **§13** crowd memory · **§16** memory tests · **§17** situation-first clarity **when §17 scope is active** · **§3B** density level for the genre lane. Hook craft → **Hit Song Psychology §3 Behavioral Hook** (User-Proxy) + **Music Creation §4**. Never paste verse phrases verbatim into chorus.

