## §5 — BREAKDOWN ENHANCEMENT (ELECTRONIC)

For trance · techno · melodic techno · progressive electronic · festival EDM when arrangement includes a breakdown:

* Breakdown feels **more personal** than the drop
* Allow: whispered vocals · double-tracked intimate lines · stripped instrumentation · reflective storytelling
* Block 2: **ARRANGEMENT STAGING FORMAT**; breakdowns → whispered/double-track vocals under intimate staging
* Block 1: note breakdown intimacy in arrangement arc (one clause)

