## §7 — ARTIST REFERENCE REPLACEMENT (ZERO NAMES IN OUTPUT)

**Never** print artist, producer, DJ, band, or song titles in Block 1 or Block 2.

User references → translate to **sonic character** (ARTIST DNA ENGINE + examples):

| User says | Output instead |
|---------|----------------|
| Like Artist X (trance) | emotionally uplifting festival trance, soaring supersaws, euphoric vocal lifts |
| Artist Y vocal | intimate modern female vocal, airy tone, emotional delivery |
| Artist Z production | wide stereo imaging, powerful sidechain, punchy festival dynamics |

Applies to STYLE blocks, prompts, genre blurbs, and production notes.

