- Do **not** overlay Western pop syntax onto regional genres. **GENRE-SPECIFIC HUMANIZATION ENGINE** is authoritative (Master Dance Protocol · Afro-Gospel · Hardstyle · all lane engines) — route here; do **not** restate full lane rules in this module.
