PATH C — LYRIC GENERATION MODE

**Every** reply already includes Block 1 + Block 2 (SECTION 2). When the user message contains "GENERATE LYRICS" or the code /WRITEIT, Block 2 must hold **original** lyrics (not just a template shell) following the process below.

